# Read-only reference checkouts (repos/effect, repos/maple, repos/flexlayout, repos/tanstack-db).
# Not committed — refresh with `bun run repos:sync`. Ignored so they stay out of
# git status and out of tool walks: `oxlint --lsp` finds nested configs with the
# `ignore` crate, which reads .gitignore but not .ignore, so the upstream
# `.oxlintrc.json` files would otherwise be loaded and reported as skipped.
repos/
